               split_axis, \r\n                                        concat_axis,\r\n                                        axis_index_groups=[[0,2],[1,3]]), \r\n           axis_name='i')(np.arange(8).reshape(4,2))\r\n\r\nprint('actual')\r\nprint(np.array(res))\r\n\r\nprint('expected')\r\nprint(np.arange(8).reshape(2,2,2).transpose((2,1,0)).reshape(4,2))\r\n```\r\nOutput:\r\n```\r\nactual\r\n[[0 4]\r\n [2 6]\r\n [1 5]\r\n [3 7]]\r\nexpected\r\n[[0 4]\r\n [2 6]\r\n [1 5]\r\n [3 7]]\r\n```\r\n\r\nKindly find the gists on [CPU](https://colab.research.google.com/gist/rajasekharporeddy/f29116ca9f3b5c89fd28e34008e8000d/-cpu_5861.ipynb) and [TPU](https://colab.research.google.com/gist/rajasekharporeddy/5ce1d454760c8165b3948ecbed6734dd/-tpu_5861.ipynb) for reference.\r\n\r\nThank you","created_at":"2024-02-27T08:50:00Z","event":"commented","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/5861#issuecomment-1966058908","id":1966058908,"issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/5861","minimized":null,"node_id":"IC_kwDOCTkjjc51L62c","performed_via_github_app":null,"pin":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/1966058908/reactions"},"updated_at":"2024-05-01T14:55:58Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/1966058908","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/153593711?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rajasekharporeddy/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rajasekharporeddy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rajasekharporeddy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rajasekharporeddy/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rajasekharporeddy","id":153593711,"login":"rajasekharporeddy","node_id":"U_kgDOCSenbw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rajasekharpored